// B36: the root view (GetRoot()) answers view methods in newtc, where it
// isn't a view of its own (each of its children is a window): GlobalBox
// and LocalBox are the screen, ChildViewFrames the open apps; Hide, Show
// do nothing. These threw "nil view" (and with a window open, the break
// loop waited). The ROM's ButtonToggle (how Extras opens an app) uses
// them: it opens the Hello app, and closes it when it is in front.
ref0;
